  "summary": "What's Changed Update claude action by @mozzius in #11420 Route Claude workflows through Agent Gateway by @amckinley in #11428 Bump version to v1.131.0 by @mozzius in #11429 claude: use Opus 4.8 for GitHub workflows by @amckinley in #11436 perf: skip minute-tick subscription for actors without a live status by @tomekzaw in #11441 Bump the actions group with…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Update claude action by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11420\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11420</a></li>\n<li>Route Claude workflows through Agent Gateway by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11428\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11428</a></li>\n<li>Bump version to v1.131.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11429\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11429</a></li>\n<li>claude: use Opus 4.8 for GitHub workflows by <a href=\"https://github.com/amckinley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amckinley</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11436\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11436</a></li>\n<li>perf: skip minute-tick subscription for actors without a live status by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11441\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11441</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group with 4 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11435\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11435</a></li>\n<li>Update pnpm to 11.21.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11427\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11427</a></li>\n<li>Fix appearance of post numbers on image posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11446\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11446</a></li>\n<li>Disallow robots crawling compose intent paths by <a href=\"https://github.com/blackmichael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@blackmichael</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11443\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11443</a></li>\n<li>Prevent last line of post text from being clipped on Android by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11433\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11433</a></li>\n<li>Fix layout jog when rendering post numbers by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11447</a></li>\n<li>algo team reply feedback by <a href=\"https://github.com/jlgleason\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@jlgleason</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11444\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11444</a></li>\n<li>Add asset licensing notices by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11397\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11397</a></li>\n<li>Separate landing illustrations from splash assets by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11453\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11453</a></li>\n<li>Fix frozen unknown device ID for new accounts by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11449\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11449</a></li>\n<li>Client events for beta features settings page by <a href=\"https://github.com/abenzer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abenzer</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11439\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11439</a></li>\n<li>Include user&#x27;s handle in beta features feedback by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11432\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11432</a></li>\n<li>Fix starter pack icon in profile menu by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11452\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11452</a></li>\n<li>APP-2829 Update video lexicon and beta features for 10-minute uploads by <a href=\"https://github.com/blackmichael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@blackmichael</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11445\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11445</a></li>\n<li>APP-1645: Improve video upload progress indicator by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11248</a></li>\n<li>Remove workaround for iOS text clipping by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11455\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11455</a></li>\n<li>Fix display of link cards in DMs by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11458\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11458</a></li>\n<li>Updated Media Icons by <a href=\"https://github.com/MrNuma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@MrNuma</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11457\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11457</a></li>\n<li>Update image in deploy-ota.md by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11462\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11462</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Rebuild the session core on PasswordSession behind an AtpAgent compat shim by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11343\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11343</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Add lexicon codegen pipeline (<code>@atproto/lex</code>) by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11346\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11346</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Add lex client seam and typed xrpc error matching by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11348\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11348</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Add lexicon schema helpers to <code>#/types/bsky</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11349\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11349</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Add pds and chat clients and the canonical client hooks by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11350\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11350</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Widen <code>#/types/bsky</code> views to dual-world unions by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11353\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11353</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate discovery and post-thread queries to the appview client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11355\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11355</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate profile and graph read queries to the appview client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11356\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11356</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate chat convo queries to the chat client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11357\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11357</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate group chat and join links to the chat client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11358\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11358</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate search, bookmarks, contacts and feed queries to the lex clients by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11360\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11360</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the feed api classes to the appview client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11361\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11361</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the notifications cluster to the lex clients by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11362\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11362</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the account surface to the pds and service clients by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11367\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11367</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Route moderation reports through the appview client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11368\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11368</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Adopt @bsky.app/sdk and migrate RichText by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11369\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11369</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate getAllListMembers to the appview client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11377</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the gate records to raw repo calls on the pds client by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11378\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11378</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the repo writes cluster by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11379\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11379</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate the post pipeline and blob uploads by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11380\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11380</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Add refreshSession and migrate the session-pinned infra by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11381\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11381</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Migrate agent sugar to @bsky.app/sdk actions by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11382\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11382</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Swap moderation to @bsky.app/sdk and move labeler config to Client statics by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11383\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11383</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Delete the bridge agent and rework the session bundle onto lex clients by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11385\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11385</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Remove @atproto/api by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11386\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11386</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Validate and brand the persisted account did by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11387\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11387</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Address stack review feedback by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11389</a></li>\n<li>[SDK] Use finalised package by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11398\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11398</a></li>\n<li>Drop accidental eslint dependency by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11460\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11460</a></li>\n<li>Fix metro failing to resolve @ipld/dag-cbor in dev mode by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11467\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11467</a></li>\n<li>Fix <code>lab_*</code> preferences by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11470\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11470</a></li>\n<li>Fix size of post numbers with emoji-only posts by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11471</a></li>\n<li>Bump node in / by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11481\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11481</a></li>\n<li>Bump anthropics/claude-code-action from 1.0.187 to 1.0.189 in the actions group across 1 directory by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11479\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11479</a></li>\n<li>APP-2774: Add algorithmic visibility setting by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11417</a></li>\n<li>Fix asset licensing notices by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11468\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11468</a></li>\n<li>Add pagination to feed search by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11475\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11475</a></li>\n<li>Truncate gif alt text to 2000 symbols by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11488\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11488</a></li>\n<li>APP-2884: Avoid base64 reads for web videos by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11493\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11493</a></li>\n<li>APP-2859 Add web list performance telemetry by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11486\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11486</a></li>\n<li>Expo 57 by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11334\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11334</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/jlgleason\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@jlgleason</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11444\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11444</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/compare/1.130.0...1.131.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.130.0...1.131.0</a></p>",
